  "description": "I quit my job, became a voice actor, and drastically changed my looks — all to catch the attention of dreamy Jaehyun from work. But he doesn’t know I’m me! What he does know is that I dub his favorite animation, and adores the way I sound. On top of that, now he’s moved in next door too?! A perfect chance for neighborly love!\n\n(Source: TappyToon)",
